{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07665","headline":"洛出书 · 萧昕","name":"洛出书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内昔凋瘵，天网斯浡潏。\n龟灵啓圣图，龙马负书出。\n大哉明德盛，远矣彝伦秩。\n地敷作乂功，人免爲鱼恤。\n既彰千国理，岂止百川溢。\n永赖至於今，畴庸未云毕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧昕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}